<h1>Start2Macros</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> Defines a toolbar with 2 large buttons and custom scripts assigned to each button.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Parameters</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription" style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><b><i><span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>C</b></i>aptionPrompt</span></i></b> - sets the name of the toolbar.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription" style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>Prompt1</b></i></span> - sets the name of button No1 on the toolbar</p>
<p class="parameterdescription" style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>Command1</b></i></span> - defines the macro command to be executed when pressing on button No1.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription" style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>Prompt2</b></i></span> - sets the name of button No2 on the toolbar</p>
<p class="parameterdescription" style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><i style="font-style:italic;"><span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>Command2</b></i></span> <span style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;">-</span></i> defines the macro command to be executed when pressing on button No2.</b></p>
<p class="Note"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Notes</b></span>:<br>
1. All parameters have no default values.<br>
2. The macro command defined for each button could be also a script call, i.e. RunScript() instead of an ordinary command.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle">&#160;</p>
<p class="Warning">Warning: <span style="font-weight:normal;">Unlike the normal command syntax, all values defined in the macros nested in the Command1 and Command2 should be closed in apostrophes instead of quotes!</span></p>
<p class="Warning">&#160;</p>
<p class="parameterstitle">UI Commands: none</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Example:</p>
<p class="ExampleCode" style="font-family:Courier New;">Start2Macros( CaptionPrompt="Transformation Method Selection", Prompt1="3-2-1 Transformation", Command1="RunScript( FileName='G:\Gamo\321.txt' )", Prompt2="N Points Transformation", Command2="RunScript( FileName='G:\Gamo\NPoints.txt' )" )</p>
<p class="ExampleCode" style="font-family:Courier New;">&#160;</p>
<p class="ExampleCode" style="font-family:Courier New; text-decoration:underline;"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example result</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP171096886" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p class="whs4"><img src="../Images/start2macros.png" width="462px" height="224px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
<p class="whs4">&#160;</p>
<p class="whs4">When pressing on one of the toolbar buttons the macro assigned to it will be executed.</p>
</div>
